<div class="lead" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
  There's no paid version, no "pro" plan, no monthly fee. Project Broadsheet is genuinely free to use, for anything, forever. The only reason this page exists is because sometimes people would rather not do it themselves.
</div>

<section class="pricing-section">
  <header class="pricing-section__header">
