      <p>A flat hourly rate, same for everything.</p>
      <ul class="pricing-card__list">
        <li>Getting a new publication online</li>
        <li>Moving an existing archive over from somewhere else</li>
        <li>A new page, section, or layout built to your spec</li>
        <li>A walk-through or training session</li>
        <li>Fixing something that isn't behaving</li>
        <li>A second pair of eyes on a decision you're stuck on</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/book-a-call/">Get in touch</a>
